<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.9915.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.9915.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.9915 versus the dollar, down from 2.9730 on Thursday, and at 1.8365 versus the mark, down from 1.8115, it said.</p>
<p>The NBP fixed the zloty at an average of 2.19 percent from the weighted central dollar and mark parity rates, down from Thursday's 3.10 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
